WEBVTT

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.190
What are you saying?

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.030
I'm not human, you know.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.130
I'll cause a lot of trouble for you.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.820
For Sanae, too.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.770
So what?

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.420
No matter what you are,

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.080
in tough times, you should 
be with others.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.830
You left because you wanted to 
see what was outside, right?

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:26.350
Then do that.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.840
Don't go back on your word.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.130
I hate crooked stuff, you know.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.190
Y-You must be an idiot!

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.660
I see.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.320
Sorry I'm late.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.530
I'm here to save you.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:06.290
I'm Cabinet Information Research Office 
Secret Service agent Ichijo Shizuku.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.250
We'll be taking you two with us!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>A Home to Return to</b>

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:56.160
Um, I will now read back your order.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.550
Three stewed Hamburg steak B meals,

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:02.320
four mozzarella pizzas, 
two mushroom risottos,

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.640
three herb and chicken salads, 
and three orders of focaccia.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:06.700
Is that correct?

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.850
Yes, and the drink bar for four, please.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.500
Drink bar for four.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.100
Thank you very much.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.270
Yes?

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.200
What?

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:22.800
Yes, the container holding the 
Red Queen has been stolen.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:26.100
I believe the thief possessed 
a Dream of Alice.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.600
Surely not from before.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.730
I strongly suggest that you retreat,

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.730
former Second Lieutenant 
Minnie C. Tachibana.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.780
I won't let you have her.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.940
The Red Queen is my last...

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.360
Operation 3-1.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.640
#590, operation 1-8.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.680
Different types of cards?!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:08.900
#51!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.230
#15!

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.110
For now, that should stop them.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:32.020
Is either one of you hurt?

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.690
You are just the best, Ichijo-senpai!

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:44.420
God, you're so awesome...

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:49.220
I wish I could've seen you kicking 
ass from down below!

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.220
<b>Voice</b>

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.260
<i>Quiet, Yamada.</i>

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:51.980
What's happening around us?

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:53.190
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:56.100
<i>No sign of the enemy within one 
kilometer of the target ship.</i>

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:59.900
<i>The Mirror Gate is still responding. 
Please be careful.</i>

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.620
<i>Just count on Yamada Noriko's special</i>

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:11.490
<b>Voice</b>

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:06.130
<i>new and improved, pan-global, 
Ichijo-detection system!</i>

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.230
<i>Not necessary.</i>

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:09.480
The annoying girl is Yamada,

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.490
the team director of technology.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.450
I don't understand it all, but...

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:17.040
She takes base station data 
from geostationary satellites

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:21.100
and cell phones to form a system 
that locates Dreams of Alice,

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.940
or more specifically, Ichijo-kun...

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.220
<i>Really, she's just my stalker.</i>

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.180
Sta...

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.230
<i>She always shows up at my 
destinations before I do.</i>

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:31.130
<i>At first, I wondered whose 
agent she was.</i>

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:31.990
<i>How rude!</i>

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.060
<i>Call me your unwelcome little sister.</i>

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.700
<i>Or at least your fan!</i>

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:38.670
She's the best hacker around,

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.900
but she's also like this.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.940
It did take a while to enable it to 
detect anyone other than senpai,

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.960
<i>so locating the escort was delayed.</i>

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:52.370
Sana-chan, I'm sorry you went 
through something so scary.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.210
Now, let's go home.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.380
<i>Senpai! Incoming!</i>

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.600
#12!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.300
Operation 3-6.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.220
#21.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.720
They can turn invisible, 
just as our intel said.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.310
Both of you, stay behind me.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.460
#576 through #580.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:30.450
Operation 2-4. Add paralysis attribute.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.600
I remember now.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:38.040
The day of the typhoon, you were 
the one who got in my way.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.060
Just what are you?

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:46.090
How are you able to use 
so many types of cards?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.550
Everyone should be restricted to one.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.260
Perhaps it's just talent?

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:59.240
But... But this is all I have!

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:04.900
#12!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.080
Darling,

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.920
please lend me just a bit more strength.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:30.790
<i>Yamada!</i>

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.160
Y-Yes, Senpai!

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.480
<i>Don't bring the helicopter any closer.</i>

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.760
<i>Stand by overhead!</i>

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.530
Get too close, and you'll 
be knocked down.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.410
<b>Voice</b>

00:07:58.900 --> 00:07:59.760
<i>Sana-chan...</i>

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.990
<i>Can you hear me? This is Ichijo.</i>

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:03.670
Oh...

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.630
Take this. #66.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.840
<i>Use that to replenish your energy.</i>

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:16.680
<b>Voice</b>

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.130
What is this?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.170
<i>It's candy.</i>

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:15.570
<i>It's very sweet, so eat it slowly.</i>

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.680
<i>There's water, too.</i>

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.340
I'm going to find a way 
to stop that woman.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.180
When you get your powers back,

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.150
take Kashimura-san and escape.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.650
Do you remember the helicopter 
that was above?

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:38.450
<b>Voice</b>

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:32.660
<i>If you can reach it, the scary people 
won't follow anymore.</i>

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.220
<i>You'll win, Sana-chan!</i>

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.920
Okay, got it.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:38.450
Hey...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.370
It'll be okay.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.460
You said it'll be okay, so it'll be okay.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:46.580
I see.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.590
Someday, I'll be the one to save you!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.030
H-Hey, I can't open this.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:56.970
You open it.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:08.300
At eight o'clock!

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.240
No... ten o'clock...

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.730
The second row of containers!

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:12.900
No, wait...

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.180
Um, um...

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:16.610
<b>Voice</b>

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.610
<i>Calm down, Yamada.</i>

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.470
<i>I'm sorry, but there's still 
a large margin of error.</i>

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.530
<i>I know!</i>

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.270
<i>If I tell myself you're the target,</i>

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.530
<i>my motivation and accuracy 
will exponentially increase!</i>

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:25.600
That's enough of that!

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.070
#381!

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.510
<i>She stays hidden, while the invisible 
arms strike with precision.</i>

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:35.400
<i>Where is she?</i>

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:40.220
Senpai!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.940
Yamada... Where is she?

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.190
<i>Oh, right!</i>

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.520
Stay calm...

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.650
<i>Stay calm...</i>

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.300
<i>I found her!</i>

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.530
At three o'clock, the seventh 
row of containers!

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.570
<i>I'm such a genius!</i>

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:10.330
This is the end.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.340
I really don't like it

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.010
when I have to get serious.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:32.900
#1!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.500
There it is!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.900
#1!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:42.700
#2.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.530
#3.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:51.580
I hate using the single digits.

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:54.340
I can't pull punches with them.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.300
Just what are you?!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.660
<i>All right!</i>

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.220
<i>Let's do it!</i>

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:06.800
<i>#12.</i>

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:10.230
<i>Operation 1-8.</i>

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.600
Stay out of

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:52.480
our way!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.650
Didn't I tell you...

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:06.740
I can't pull punches.

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:23.830
Former Second Lieutenant 
Minnie C. Tachibana,

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.280
you are under immediate arrest

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:29.640
for abduction of a minor, 
assault, and bodily harm.

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:38.720
This is a magic storeroom that 
some maid in an anime used.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:43.400
It showed up one night, after I'd 
fallen asleep with the TV on.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:49.130
666 weapons and 13 grimoires 
are stored inside.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.800
I'm basically a human weapon.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.180
Ridiculous, isn't it?

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.690
I don't believe

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.840
these are things that appear for the 
purpose of granting our wishes.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.550
<i>Out of energy...</i>

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:23.770
<i>How long have I been alone?</i>

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:29.130
<i>Long ago, I realized that the 
gears had slipped off-track.</i>

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:31.960
<i>But still, I am unable to stop.</i>

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.880
<i>What am I to do?</i>

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:39.590
<i>To think that I must... go on living.</i>

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.550
<i>Tomorrow, the next day, and beyond.</i>

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:48.070
<i>I am sorry, darling...</i>

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:51.690
<i>I'm sorry that I am still alive.</i>

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.750
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.830
Hey, Zoroku.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.050
What?

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:24.010
I think I'm going to cause 
more trouble for people,

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.260
just by existing in the outside world.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:31.220
Even if I don't, I'll probably 
still make lots of mistakes.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:36.300
I don't know why I was made this way,

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.800
in this form,

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:41.190
but someone made me.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.340
Within this world,

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:47.190
someone wanted me to do 
something in human form.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.120
You know, Zoroku...

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:55.930
I want to be human!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:03.050
Or if not human, I want to 
be something more real.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.410
I don't know how to say it, but...

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:06.790
I want to know lots more!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.300
About humans, about you and Sanae,

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.110
and about how much there 
is to this world.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.630
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:20.690
By doing that, I want to become 
something more real.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:24.730
And one day, I want to find 
out why I was made,

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.980
and why I'm not human—

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:29.950
I'm hungry.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.660
Someday, you'll understand it all.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:35.700
Yeah.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.560
And my hair...

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.180
I can do it myself, but I want 
Sanae to do it for me.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:56.680
Ask her when we get back.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:58.180
Yeah!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.330
That's a nice view...

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:19.520
Pretty amazing.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:21.650
Isn't it?

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.460
I can do anything!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.560
Thank you very much.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.090
Yes, that's right.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:50.640
The situation's changed.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.150
Dispose of all the Dreams of Alice data.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.990
And until you hear from me again...

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.060
Kito Koichi-san, correct?

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.410
That's right.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:01.650
Oh, pardon me...

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:04.080
I'm with the Yotsuya police.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.520
I'm really sorry about this, old man.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:14.370
Given the commotion this 
ended up involving,

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:17.400
life will probably be noisy for a while.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.710
You might as well give up.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:20.680
<i>Hmph!</i>

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.990
Well, on that note.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:25.100
Where are you now?

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.610
I don't know.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:29.460
I'm in the sky.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:42.910
<b>Voice</b>

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:33.120
<i>Well, that's fine.</i>

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.950
<i>Just try not to let people see 
you or take pictures.</i>

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.450
<i>It'd make my life hell.</i>

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.870
Hear that, Sana?

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:41.440
B-But it wasn't me...

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.910
This wasn't on purpose!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.700
Every now and then, I guess it's fine.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:49.010
Not every day you get to 
fly around in the sky.

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.160
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:53.170
<i>It grosses me out when 
you're in a good mood.</i>

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.290
Does it?

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.300
Well, it happens sometimes.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:18:00.890
<b>Voice</b>

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:59.360
After all, I got another 
granddaughter today.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:00.890
Sanae will be happy, too.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.560
You idiot!

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:09.580
H-Hey, Zoroku.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:12.800
Um...

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.860
I'm sorry I knocked over those vases today.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.900
You should say those things sooner.

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.390
Okay.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:24.060
Let's go home.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.150
Yeah.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:43.760
<i>And that was how our family 
gained a new member today.</i>

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:46.560
<b>Authorized Personnel Only Past This Point</b>

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.560
<i>Ichijo-san and the others said</i>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.740
<i>the scary organization that had 
held Sana-chan prisoner</i>

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:56.170
<i>was dismantled shortly after that.</i>

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.320
<i>And after the incident,</i>

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:03.800
<i>the people opposing Naito-san 
and his team quieted down.</i>

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.180
<i>Grandpa complained</i>

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:09.370
<i>that the way Naito-san had 
used him disgusted him.</i>

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:13.970
<i>The military lady who took Sana-chan</i>

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.870
<i>returned to her own country due to a...</i>

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.420
<i>protection agreement or something?</i>

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.190
Oh, welcome back, Sanae.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.610
Thanks, Sana-chan.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.830
Going to water the flowers?

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:24.200
Yep, that's my job.

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:30.280
When the soil's dry, give them water.

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:34.660
Looks like you don't need 
water too badly today.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:40.420
That's because it rained a 
little bit yesterday.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.060
I see!

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:45.460
<i>She's so cute!</i>

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:49.400
Prune the wilted blossoms...

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:54.290
There.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:00.360
This looks great!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.090
Okay, let's eat.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:02.780
Yeah.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:07.410
By the way... Lately, you seem 
to have more stamina, huh?

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:11.070
Let's all go somewhere to play soon.

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:11.740
Okay!

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:13.380
What's "play"?

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.780
Where are we going?

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:17.680
Maybe a theme park or a zoo!

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.630
I bet you've never been to a zoo, right?

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.230
Or an aquarium...

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.430
Aqua... What is that?

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:29.060
Or a hot spring.

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:29.750
Hot spring?

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:30.960
What's a hot spring?

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:33.130
Oh, hot springs are great.

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:35.020
They're paradise!

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.100
Paradise?

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.440
Is that amazing?

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:38.570
For now, let's just eat.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.740
Time to eat.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.150
Time to eat!

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:49.670
Sounds like they're having a great time.

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:50.620
It sure does.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.630
So peaceful.

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.520
Little to do...

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:59.080
I wish we'd have another incident.

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:02.630
That's so rash.
